<v Host>They are seven products, like the Zaku Zaku Juicy Mac, made with chicken thigh meat.

00:02:36.276 --> 00:02:38.580
<v Vocab>商品

00:02:38.979 --> 00:02:41.860
<v Host>It means product, or goods for sale.

00:02:42.460 --> 00:02:51.747
<v Slow>これらの商品は、10月21日に売り始めた、新しいメニューです。

00:02:52.548 --> 00:02:57.036
