00:02:57.635 --> 00:03:06.707
<v Slow>外側はザクザクしていて、中には厚い鶏肉が1枚入っています。

00:03:07.508 --> 00:03:12.379
<v Host>The outside is crunchy, and inside there is one thick piece of chicken.

00:03:12.979 --> 00:03:15.187
<v Vocab>厚い

00:03:15.587 --> 00:03:19.403
<v Host>It means thick, for things like meat, books or walls.

00:03:20.003 --> 00:03:31.211
<v Slow>しかし、思っていたよりずっとたくさん売れたため、鶏肉を十分に用意するのが難しくなりました。

00:03:32.012 --> 00:03:37.243
<v Host>But they sold much more than expected, so it became hard to prepare enough chicken.

00:03:37.843 --> 00:03:40.364
<v Vocab>用意する

00:03:40.764 --> 00:03:43.788
<v Host>It means to prepare or get something ready.

00:03:44.388 --> 00:03:52.283
<v Slow>そのため、11月13日から、売るのを休んでいました。

00:03:53.084 --> 00:03:57.955
<v Host>So from November thirteenth, the company stopped selling them for a while.

00:03:58.556 --> 00:04:06.524
<v Slow>会社は、準備ができたので、また売ることにしたと話しています。

00:04:07.324 --> 00:04:11.644
<v Host>The company says it is ready now, so it decided to sell them again.

00:04:12.243 --> 00:04:14.475
<v Vocab>準備

00:04:14.876 --> 00:04:19.124
<v Host>It means preparation. Ready means the preparation is done.

00:04:19.723 --> 00:04:28.699
<v Slow>30日は、午前10時半から、全国の店で買うことができます。

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:35.307
<v Host>On the thirtieth, you can buy them at shops all over the country from ten thirty in the morning.

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:38.307
<v Vocab>全国

00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:41.803
<v Host>It means the whole country, or nationwide.

00:04:42.403 --> 00:04:52.771
<v Slow>12月6日までの1週間は、アプリのクーポンで、セットが100円安くなります。

00:04:53.572 --> 00:04:59.572
<v Host>For one week until December sixth, sets are one hundred yen cheaper with an app coupon.

00:05:00.172 --> 00:05:07.827
<v Slow>夜5時からは、チキンが2枚入ったハンバーガーも食べられます。

00:05:08.627 --> 00:05:13.524
<v Host>From five in the evening, you can also eat burgers with two pieces of chicken.

